Project Planning Phase

 The **Project Planning Phase** converts the requirements identified in the Requirement Analysis Phase into a structured implementation plan. The objective is to define the activities, sequence, resources, roles, test strategy, and expected deliverables required to implement the **Script-Controlled ACL – Restrict Record Access Based on Field Value** lab in ServiceNow.

 ## 1\. Project Objective

 The objective of this project is to implement a secure custom ServiceNow table in which access to records is controlled using **role-based ACLs and a Branch field condition**.

 The planned access model is:

 | Operation | Required Role | Purpose |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Read | `bb1` | Access permitted records |
| Create | `bb2` | Create new records |
| Write | `bb3` | Modify existing records |
| Delete | `bb4` | Delete records |
| Administrative access | `admin` | Full access |

For the read requirement, the intended rule is that an EEE-authorized user can access **EEE records**, while administrators can access all records.

