 # 6\. Phase 3 – Table and Field Configuration

 Create the custom table:

```
Label: Institution Details
Name: u_institution_details
```

 The table will contain:

 | Field | Type |
| --- | --- |
| Student Roll Number | Auto Number |
| Student Name | Reference → User |
| Faculty Name | Reference → User |
| Branch | Choice |
| Email | String |
| Phone Number | String |
| Description | Multi-line String |

The Branch field will contain:

```
ECE
EEE
CSE
```

 ### Planning Consideration

 The **Branch** field is the critical field for the record-level security requirement.

 Therefore, it must be populated consistently in the test data so that ACL behavior can be verified.

 ### Deliverable

 A functional `u_institution_details` table containing all required fields.

