 # 9\. Phase 6 – CREATE ACL Planning

 The CREATE ACL will control whether a user can create a new Institution Details record.

 ### Configuration

```
Type: Record
Operation: Create
Name: u_institution_details
Active: True
Required Role: bb2
```

 No Branch data condition is planned for this ACL according to the lab specification.

 ### Expected Access

```
bb1 only                 → No Create
bb1 + bb2                → Create
bb1 + bb2 + bb3          → Create
bb1 + bb2 + bb3 + bb4    → Create
admin                    → Create
```

 ### Deliverable

 A CREATE ACL that requires `bb2`.

