 # 12\. Access Control Matrix

 The final planned permission model is:

 | User Configuration | Read | Create | Write | Delete |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| No custom roles | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ |
| `bb1` | ✅\* | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ |
| `bb1 + bb2` | ✅\* | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ |
| `bb1 + bb2 + bb3` | ✅\* | ✅ | ✅ | ❌ |
| `bb1 + bb2 + bb3 + bb4` | ✅\* | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |
| `admin` | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |

`*` Read access is subject to the Branch-based requirement.

