 # 17\. Risk Planning

 | Risk | Impact | Mitigation |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Incorrect role assignment | User receives unexpected access | Verify roles before testing |
| Incorrect Branch values | Read test results become unreliable | Create records for all three branches |
| ACL condition incorrectly configured | Unauthorized records may be visible | Test each branch separately |
| Script bypasses Branch condition | `bb1` users may see unintended records | Test EEE, ECE, and CSE independently |
| Missing `security_admin` | ACL cannot be configured | Elevate role before ACL creation |
| ACL cache/session effects | Old behavior may appear during testing | Re-test after ACL changes |
| Admin testing only | Security issue may remain undetected | Always impersonate non-admin users |
| Create/Write/Delete roles overlap incorrectly | Excess permissions | Test each CRUD operation independently |

